  "title": "NVMe: fix parsing ANA Get LogPage response.",
  "description": "There are logical errors in decoding Get LogPage ANA response.\n\nThis commit fixes the errors.\n\nDecoding before the fix: ![image](/uploads/1afca9f21dc2f1531ce3ccb76e886772/image.png) ![image](/uploads/cfd69c20cba4f56106ecc4ff986f5ad3/image.png)\n\n\nDecoding after the fix: ![image](/uploads/a9bec2b529ba7f50398abc36e1dfbb3f/image.png), ![image](/uploads/cbbda5707f7dc380f2a18faa099dc772/image.png)\n\nThe problem was iterating between diffrent groups (we need to take number of entries into account), and the size of namespace ID was decoded as 2 bytes, while it is 4 bytes.",
